    "expensive_path": "the per-fluid flux and source evaluation: separate Riemann solves per ion and neutral fluid, the multi-ion momentum and electron-pressure coupling sources, and the point-implicit update of the stiff ion-electron friction and five-moment Lorentz-force sources in every cell",
